Lake resolves the outerplanar, tractability, bounded-cost, and approximation
developments at their sibling paths in lakefile.toml. The common CPAP and
minor-free packages and the NP-completeness foundation are inherited
dependencies. Temporary Challenge specifications reproduce the required
CNF, CPAP, flow, encoding, greedy, relaxation, and RAM definitions from
those dependencies and import the pinned Mathlib module. They are generated
for comparison and omitted from the distribution and default proof build.
